config INPUT_MIMIO
	tristate "Mimio Xi interactive whiteboard support"
	depends on USB && INPUT
	default N
	help
	  Say Y here if you want to use a Mimio Xi interactive
	  whiteboard device.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called mimio.
